              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="15">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Reads the elements of the active Rhino document back into component passport JSON. A D2P component (made by PassportToD2P and committed with D2P) is read from the user text of its members, with the placement from the plane of the D2P component now. An element baked by BakeComponents is read from its tag; a bake is not a D2P component, so its Component output is null. The component passport comes from the stored csc_component or by id through the Session. Nothing is written to the server.</item>
